# Route trace of ONE run of `crates/providers/delonix-proxmox/tests/live.rs` against a real node.
# Written by the client with DELONIX_PROXMOX_TRACE_ROUTES (ADR-0049); the header is provenance, the rest is every request of the run.
# Untested after this run, and why: GET /nodes/{node}/tasks is the lost-answer reconciliation, reached only through failure injection (tests/failure_injection.rs); the agent/exec family beyond agent/ping needs a hand-prepared guest with qemu-guest-agent (DELONIX_PROXMOX_TEST_AGENT_VMID), not set in this run.
# product: Proxmox VE
# version: 9.2.2
# node: pve — a libvirt VM (pve-lab-475) on the developer host, booted from this repository's appliance image proxmox-ve_9.2.qcow2; storage local-lvm for the VM disk, local for backup archives
# run: 2026-09-24T18:39Z
# command: DELONIX_PROXMOX_TEST_URL=https://<node>:8006 DELONIX_PROXMOX_TEST_NODE=pve DELONIX_PROXMOX_TEST_USER=root@pam DELONIX_PROXMOX_TEST_PASS=… DELONIX_PROXMOX_TEST_BACKUP_STORAGE=local DELONIX_PROXMOX_TRACE_ROUTES=docs/proxmox/trace-9.2.2.routes cargo test -p delonix-proxmox --test live -- --nocapture --test-threads=1
# result: 6 passed (o_ip_vem_do_agente_de_um_convidado_a_serio skipped: no DELONIX_PROXMOX_TEST_AGENT_VMID); the lifecycle case walks create → snapshot (RAM) → rollback → delete-snapshot → stop → resume → stop → destroy; the template case makes its own template, grows it, refuses a shrink clone, clones it at two sizes, destroys the clones and the template; the backup case backs up a running VM twice, lists the archives, deletes both, and confirms an unknown volid is refused; the new case pings a guest with no agent through POST …/agent/ping and confirms it answers Ok(false), never an Err — agent_exec/agent_exec_status compile and are covered by the TLS mock and a unit test, but need a hand-prepared guest with a real qemu-guest-agent to prove live, not available in this run; the node registers the workers as `qmcreate`/`qmstart`/`qmstop`/`qmsnapshot`/`qmrollback`/`qmdelsnapshot`/`qmdestroy`/`qmconfig`/`qmclone`/`qmtemplate`/`resize`/`vzdump`/`imgdel` — `agent/ping` forks no task at all (answers inline, as expected for a guest-agent query)
